  "body": "Experimental 2026.10.4-rc.2 preview.\n\n- Switch between Tasks and Food from the toolbar dropdown, with a compact icon on narrow screens.\n- Tasks now defaults to full-width Search, with Add available from the toolbar.\n- Food Stock includes undated items at the top. Choose Stock, Retained or Deleted from Filter, with expiration colors showing what needs attention.\n- Food Add and edit require an expiration date, using the same calendar control as Tasks. Certainty fields and optional-label suffixes are gone.\n- Undo Food additions, edits, contents changes, removals and restores through a 50-action session stack.\n- Fixed tapping the blank middle of short Inbox tasks to open the editor.\n- Fixed clipped calendar day numbers in Tasks and Food on narrow screens with larger text.\n- Fixed shifting Food controls when expanding a group, and a Task Undo notice remaining active after switching to Food.\n- Linux Flatpak now shows Tandemlog in app centers and uses private sandbox storage. Existing local settings are not migrated automatically: reset local setup and reselect your existing synced folder.\n\nUpdate every participating preview device to this release for Food Undo v2 compatibility.\n\nIf an older version cannot open your profile after an interrupted Food Undo,\nreopen this preview.\n\n![Before: Food uses a separate section row and view buttons. After: Food fits in the toolbar with Filter and expiration colors.](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reddraggone9/tandemlog/43107084646a58a5a5059271655b73b2c6d64bf9/evidence/food-2026.10.4-rc.2/media/toolbar-expanded-before-after.png)\n\n![Before: task capture fills the input row, with a compact Search button in the toolbar. After: full-width Search replaces capture, and Add moves into the toolbar.](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reddraggone9/tandemlog/43107084646a58a5a5059271655b73b2c6d64bf9/evidence/food-2026.10.4-rc.2/media/task-search-before-after.png)\n\n![Actual Linux picker at larger text. Before: two-digit calendar days are clipped. After: full day numbers fit in the shared date picker.](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/reddraggone9/tandemlog/22a13e5a83ec108392378041422fe58ed9cdae61/evidence/food-2026.10.4-rc.2/media/calendar-before-after.png)\n"
}
